OL,3,GNEWSAEight men charged in cockfighting
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight men have been charged by police
OL,7,Finvestigating illegal cockfighting.
OL,9,FThe case was brought by the RSPCA, with
OL,10,Fcharges include keeping premises in
OL,11,FBradford that were used for
OL,12,Fcockfighting and arranging illegal cock
OL,13,Ffights.
OL,15,FPhilip Brown, prosecuting on behalf of
OL,16,Fthe charity, said the charges came
OL,17,Fafter Northamptonshire Police came
OL,18,Facross an animal fight in May 2024 and
OL,19,Fa phone was seized.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
